%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-coercions-functions-tobinary (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
    "UTF-16Ex": "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"},
    utf16Ex: "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"},
    UnicodeBigEx: "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"},
    "UTF-32Ex": "AAAARAAAAFc=" as Binary {base: "64"},
    UTF_32Ex: "AAAARAAAAFc=" as Binary {base: "64"}
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::util::Coercions
output application/dw
---
{
  'UTF-16Ex': toBinary("DW", "UTF-16"),
  'utf16Ex': toBinary("DW", "utf16"),
  'UnicodeBigEx': toBinary("DW", "UnicodeBig"),
  'UTF-32Ex': toBinary("DW", "UTF-32"),
  'UTF_32Ex': toBinary("DW", "UTF_32")
}
%%% output application/dw
{
  "UTF-16Ex": "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {encoding: "UTF-16"},
  utf16Ex: "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {encoding: "utf16"},
  UnicodeBigEx: "/v8ARABX" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {encoding: "UnicodeBig"},
  "UTF-32Ex": "AAAARAAAAFc=" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {encoding: "UTF-32"},
  UTF_32Ex: "AAAARAAAAFc=" as Binary {base: "64"} as Binary {encoding: "UTF_32"}
}
